---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Profit Intelligence - AnalytXpert" description="Stop scaling your losses. Monthly profit analysis for Shopify brands spending $100k+/month on ads.">
  <div class="container max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
        Stop Scaling Your Losses.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">
        For Shopify brands spending $100k+/month on ads
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem -->
    <div class="mb-16 p-8 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border">
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">
        Meta says ROAS is 3.2x. Shopify says something different. Your bank account says something is wrong.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        Nobody is telling you the truth about profit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- What We Do -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Here's what I do:</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-8">
        Every month, I scan your business across 7 profit areas and tell you what changed and what to do next.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-3 mb-8">
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Acquisition Profitability</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Which traffic is making you money — and which isn't?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">True CAC, channel contribution margin, creative-level profitability</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Funnel &amp; Conversion Economics</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Where are you losing money between click and cash?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">LP drop-offs, checkout friction, device conversion gaps</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Offer &amp; Pricing Performance</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Which offers actually work — not just convert?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Discount impact on margin, AOV vs conversion trade-offs</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Product / SKU Profitability</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Which products should you push — and which should you stop advertising?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">SKU-level profit after ads, refunds, and returns</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Post-Purchase Revenue Efficiency</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Are upsells actually improving profit — or masking problems?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Post-purchase acceptance rates, upsell dependency risk</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Retention &amp; Customer Value Quality</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Are you buying customers worth keeping?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Repeat rate by acquisition source, time-to-second-purchase</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-secondary/20 rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Hidden Costs &amp; Revenue Erosion</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Where is profit leaking without showing up in ROAS?</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Refund lag, chargebacks, shipping overruns, attribution errors</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg border border-primary/30 mb-6">
        <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">
          I don't look at ROAS. I look at Contribution Margin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        You get: One 1-page report. One 30-minute call. No dashboards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Real Example -->
    <div class="mb-16 p-8 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Real example:</h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">
        I found a "Scale" campaign with 4.0x ROAS that was
        <span class="font-bold text-destructive">losing $4.12 per sale</span> after returns and shipping.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg mb-2">
        Client killed it. <span class="font-bold text-primary">Saved $144k/year.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        My fee? $3k/month.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Qualification -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl border border-primary/30">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">This is for you if:</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>$250k-$2M/month on Shopify</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>$100k+/month on paid ads</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>You suspect you're leaving money on the table</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">NOT for you if:</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">Under $250k/month</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">You need someone to run your ads</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing & Guarantee -->
    <div class="mb-16 p-8 bg-card rounded-xl border border-border text-center">
      <p class="text-xl mb-4">
        My fee is <span class="font-bold text-primary">$3k/month</span>. I typically find
        <span class="font-bold text-primary">$10k&ndash;$50k in leaks</span> in the first 30 days.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">
        If I don't find at least 2x my fee in the first 30 days, you don't pay.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        I'll tell you in 15 minutes if I can help.
      </h2>
      <a
        href="https://calendly.com/pracasrv/15min"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-14 px-8 text-lg font-semibold bg-primary text-primary-foreground rounded-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors mb-8"
      >
        Find my wasted spend &rarr;
      </a>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground">
        No pitch. No obligation. Just honesty.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
